> is x times x the same as x squared for an unsigned byte x?
  ucas: it(x: u8) = x*x
  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)
> is x multiplied by x equal to x squared for an unsigned byte x?
  ucas: it(x: u8) = x*x
  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)
> are x times x and x^2 equivalent for an unsigned byte x?
  ucas: it(x: u8) = x*x
  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)
